  abstract: >- # replace with your own abstract when you use this template
    Workbook for ECI 173 Foundation Engineering, a course offered at the University of California, Davis.ok is designed to provide students with a comprehensive introduction to the principles and practices of foundation engineering, including soil mechanics, foundation design, and construction techniques. The content is organized into chapters that cover key topics in the field, with examples and exercises to enhance learning. This book is intended for students, educators, and practitioners in civil engineering and related disciplines.
